      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Contracts for the period January 1, 1971 to June 30, 1973 between The City of New York and the respective exclusive bargaining representatives of employees in the classes of positions listed below, including details that are part of the respective bargaining units, provided, effective January 1, 1971 that certain cash payments for unused accrued annual leave and unused accrued compensatory time shall be made if such an employee dies while employed by the City:",
